---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="mt-24 border-t-2 border-ink bg-sheet text-ink">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 border-2 border-ink bg-dossier shadow-press md:grid-cols-12">
      <!-- Col 1: Archival Manifesto -->
      <div class="border-b-2 border-ink p-6 md:col-span-6 md:border-b-0 md:border-r-2">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5">
          <span class="font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">
            AmanDok<span class="text-vermilion">.</span>
          </span>
          <span class="border border-ink bg-verified px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-sheet">
            100% RAM SANDBOX • ZERO SERVER
          </span>
        </div>
        <p
          class="mt-3 max-w-md text-xs leading-relaxed text-slateink"
          data-i18n-id="AmanDok dirancang sebagai meja kerja forensik mandiri bagi warga Indonesia untuk mencegah penyalahgunaan scan KTP, KK, dan NPWP. Seluruh rasterisasi segel watermark, sensor piksel, dan penjilidan PDF dieksekusi di memori lokal browser tanpa transmisi jaringan."
          data-i18n-en="AmanDok is engineered as a self-contained document security lightdesk to prevent ID card and tax document leaks. All watermark rasterization, pixel destruction, and PDF binding execute strictly inside local browser RAM with zero network transmission."
        >
          AmanDok dirancang sebagai meja kerja forensik mandiri bagi warga Indonesia untuk mencegah penyalahgunaan scan KTP, KK, dan NPWP. Seluruh rasterisasi segel watermark, sensor piksel, dan penjilidan PDF dieksekusi di memori lokal browser tanpa transmisi jaringan.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 2: Pipeline Modules -->
      <div class="border-b-2 border-ink p-6 md:col-span-3 md:border-b-0 md:border-r-2">
        <h3
          class="font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-ink"
          data-i18n-id="Modul Instrumen"
          data-i18n-en="Instrument Modules"
        >
          Modul Instrumen
        </h3>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 font-mono text-xs text-slateink">
          <li><a href="#studio" class="hover:text-vermilion hover:underline">[01] Segel Watermark KTP</a></li>
          <li><a href="#studio" class="hover:text-vermilion hover:underline">[02] Sensor Piksel NIK & TTD</a></li>
          <li><a href="#studio" class="hover:text-vermilion hover:underline">[03] Presisi Target KB (CPNS)</a></li>
          <li><a href="#studio" class="hover:text-vermilion hover:underline">[04] Binder Dokumen PDF A4</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 3: Colophon & Open Source -->
      <div class="p-6 md:col-span-3">
        <h3
          class="font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-ink"
          data-i18n-id="Kolofon & Kode Sumber"
          data-i18n-en="Colophon & Source Code"
        >
          Kolofon & Kode Sumber
        </h3>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 font-mono text-xs text-slateink">
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://ritonga.ai.id"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="font-semibold text-ink hover:text-vermilion hover:underline"
            >
              Aliando Ritonga (Portfolio) ↗
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://github.com/andoritonga/amandok"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="hover:text-vermilion hover:underline"
            >
              GitHub Repository (Audit) ↗
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://gaji.ritonga.ai.id"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="hover:text-vermilion hover:underline"
            >
              HitungGaji.id (PPh 21 TER) ↗
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col items-center justify-between gap-3 font-mono text-xs text-slateink sm:flex-row">
      <p>
        © {year} AmanDok — Dirancang & Dikembangkan oleh{' '}
        <a href="https://ritonga.ai.id" class="font-bold text-ink underline decoration-vermilion decoration-2 underline-offset-2">
          Aliando Ritonga
        </a>
      </p>
      <p class="border border-ink bg-dossier px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] font-semibold text-ink">
        CSP: connect-src 'self' • ZERO TELEMETRY • ZERO CLOUD STORAGE
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
